      statement: "A citation or grandfather list stored in one place that points into source owned by another must stay valid under any edit that does not touch the construct it names. RE-SCOPED 2026-10-25: three consumers key on (path, line): test_module_key_axis.py (MODULE_KEY_NOTIONS), test_signature_axis.py (FACT_HOMES, LEGACY_VALUE_PARSERS) and signature_axis.find_undeclared_value_parsers, the closure gate, which reports false NEW undeclared parse sites after an unrelated insertion above a grandfathered line. The test-selection half is fixed (WI-lujon, scripts/citation_gate_tests.py)."  # d967
